        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a franchisor with 7,575 opened hotels, including ownership of 17 hotels and management of 13 hotels (inclusive of four owned hotels), we believe we are generally well positioned in any stage of the lodging cycle as our fee-for-service business model has historically delivered predictable and profitable, long-term growth in a variety of lodging and economic environments.",
