        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Delivering Exceptional Services - We provide a combination of services and technology-based offerings to help our franchisees improve performance.",
        "start_character": 26347,
        "end_character": 26493
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Economics of the Franchising Business - The fee and cost structure of our business provides opportunities for us to improve operating results by increasing the number of franchised hotel rooms, improving RevPAR performance, and increasing the royalty rates in our franchise contracts.",
        "start_character": 19951,
        "end_character": 20235
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our hotel franchising business, we have also developed or acquired 10 Cambria, four Everhome Suites, one Radisson RED, one Radisson Blu, and one Country Inn & Suites open and operating hotels.",
        "start_character": 8478,
        "end_character": 8685
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide our franchisees with education and training programs as well as revenue management technology and services designed to improve property-level performance.",
        "start_character": 26662,
        "end_character": 26840
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Other than four owned hotels, we currently do not manage our owned hotels but utilize the services of third-party hotel management companies that provide their own employees.",
        "start_character": 9744,
        "end_character": 9918
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that by focusing on these elements we can increase the gross room revenues generated by our franchisees by increasing the business delivered to existing franchisees and expanding our market share of franchised hotels in the chain scale categories in which we operate or seek to operate.",
        "start_character": 23582,
        "end_character": 23879
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We develop our services based on customer needs and focus on activities that generate a high return on investment for our franchisees.",
        "start_character": 27131,
        "end_character": 27265
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect our efforts at marketing directly to individual guests and corporate customers will continue to be enhanced through the use of our customer relationship management technology and programs, as well as our field-based sales agents that are focused on increasing our share of business travelers.",
        "start_character": 28326,
        "end_character": 28628
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although we believe that increases in the rate of inflation will generally result in comparable increases in hotel room rates, severe inflation could contribute to a slowing of the economies in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 78262,
        "end_character": 78473
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
        "accession_number": "0001046311-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on market conditions and other circumstances, we may offer certain incentives to developers to increase development of our brands, such as discounting various fees including the initial franchise fee, royalty fee, marketing and reservation fee, and providing franchise agreement acquisition cost payments to support development, property improvements, and other hotel expenditures.",
        "start_character": 54754,
        "end_character": 55141
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001046311-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001046311-26-000008-3cb0d6a70675ba81",
